            "\n",
            "--- Exercise 3 Results (After Appending) ---\n",
            "Hello! This is a file handling practice.\n",
            "Python makes it easy to read and write files.\n",
            "This line was appended successfully!\n",
            "\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
